### WD-1911 — Order/getById
# Una orden con sus intentos de entrega (deliveries) y su bitácora (events).

### 1) Por id
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/getById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 7252
}

### 2) Por id externo
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/getById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "CRM-1029"
}

### 3) 400: sin identificador
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/getById
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
